<title>CHINA: SOCCER-STANDINGS IN CHINA'S PROFESSIONAL LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STANDINGS IN CHINA'S PROFESSIONAL LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in China's first</p>
<p>division professional soccer league that started its new season</p>
<p>on Sunday (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>against and points):</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	  1   1   0   0   2   0   3</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua    1   1   0   0   2   0   3</p>
<p> August First	  1   1   0   0   1   0   3</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo    1   1   0   0   1   0   3</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu	1   1   0   0   1   0   3</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an	1   0   1   0   0   0   1</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxing    1   0   1   0   0   0   1</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	 1   0   0   1   0   1   0</p>
<p> Tianjin Lifei	 1   0   0   1   0   1   0</p>
<p> Guangdong Hongyuan  1   0   0   1   0   1   0</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodong	1   0   0   1   0   2   0</p>
<p> Vanguard Huandao    1   0   0   1   0   2   0</p>
</text>
